HEXIMP_MORE_INFO_TEXT=An Intel HEX or Motorola S-Record text file encodes ECU memory contents as a sequence of address+data records with checksums.\nEvery line is verified - any error causes the import to be rejected.\n\nThe offset is subtracted from each record's address before writing into the target buffer - this lets you align the file's data with the start of the chosen memory chip.\nAny gaps within the selected range are filled with byte 0xFF (erased flash/EPROM state).
